00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:45.658
And that that didn't have to be

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:46.859
in contradiction to her

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:48.461
as, like, a grown serious,

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:50.129
professional woman.

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:51.097
I have to be honest, though.

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:53.633
I was not a Barbie obsessed girl.

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:54.367
I was too busy

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:55.468
jumping out of trees

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:56.836
and racing boys

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:58.871
and trying to be better than the boys.

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:01.274
